# The tools the gate runs that rustup does not install, pinned. One version per
# tool, here and nowhere else: the ci workflow reads this file, and
# CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/dev.md point at it rather than restating a number.
#
# Every name is a crates.io package, so `cargo install` and
# taiki-e/install-action both take this list unchanged. taplo-cli installs a
# binary named taplo.
